1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:08,588
Speaking, task one. Topic 6: Work. Ten questions. Listen to the question and answer aloud.

2
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:10,954
Where do you work?

3
00:00:16,367 --> 00:00:18,984
I work in a warehouse in Kralupy.

4
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:22,680
What do you do at work every day?

5
00:00:28,067 --> 00:00:33,563
Every day I load and unload goods and check boxes.

6
00:00:34,467 --> 00:00:37,607
When do you start and finish work?

7
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:47,730
I start at six in the morning and finish at two in the afternoon.

8
00:00:48,633 --> 00:00:50,752
How do you get to work?

9
00:00:56,167 --> 00:01:00,201
I drive to work, it's about ten minutes.

10
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:03,706
Do you like your job?

11
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:14,632
I like my job because I have good colleagues, but it's quite hard.

12
00:01:15,533 --> 00:01:17,837
Do you speak Czech at work?

13
00:01:23,233 --> 00:01:28,324
Yes, I speak Czech with my boss and sometimes Ukrainian with colleagues.

14
00:01:29,233 --> 00:01:32,071
What job did you do before?

15
00:01:37,467 --> 00:01:41,001
I used to work as a taxi driver.

16
00:01:41,900 --> 00:01:44,634
How did you find this job?

17
00:01:50,033 --> 00:01:54,543
I found this job online through an agency.

18
00:01:55,433 --> 00:01:58,875
How many days of holiday will you have this year?

19
00:02:04,267 --> 00:02:07,674
This year I'll have twenty days of holiday.

20
00:02:08,567 --> 00:02:12,438
What job would you like to do in five years?

21
00:02:17,833 --> 00:02:22,715
In five years I'd like to work in an office as an accountant.

22
00:02:23,600 --> 00:02:34,275
Great! Practise topic 6 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website, the link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
